Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.55,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Supply recovery concerns the material carried by the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.58,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}恢复补给，要看军队携带的物资；
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.55,0:00:07.00,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}army; troop recovery concerns actual soldiers in its
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.58,0:00:07.05,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}恢复兵员，要看实体兵团的人数。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.00,0:00:07.66,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}regiments.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.05,0:00:09.74,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}游戏分别处理这两件事。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.66,0:00:09.81,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}The game handles them separately.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.74,0:00:14.09,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}补给增加，不会自动把缺额变成士兵；兵员
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.81,0:00:13.71,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}More supply does not automatically fill troop deficits, and
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.71,0:00:18.21,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}replenishment eligibility cannot be determined just by whether stock
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.09,0:00:18.22,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}能否补充，也不能只问库存是不是满的。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.21,0:00:18.74,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}is full.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.22,0:00:23.34,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}对一支准备继续赶路的军队，先读库存，再展开实
